<title>FINLAND: TAMRO SEES LATE-96 SALES DENTING EARLY '97.</title>
<headline>TAMRO SEES LATE-96 SALES DENTING EARLY '97.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish pharmaceuticals wholesaler Tamro Oy said in a statement on Tuesday that an exceptional increase in late 1996 sales in Sweden would reduce group sales early next year.</p>
<p>&quot;The sales of Tamro Group may reach the level of FIM 13 billion in 1996. This increase in sales will correspondingly decrease the sales of the first two to three months in 1997,&quot; Tamro said.</p>
</text>
